        <item>
            <key> <string>description</string> </key>
            <value> <string>Discover all available ERP5 modules and pending worklist items. Start here.\n
\n
    Returns the global worklist (pending tasks with counts) and all modules grouped\n
    by business application (Sales, Accounting, CRM, etc.).\n
\n
    USE THIS WHEN:\n
    - Starting any ERP5 task — call this first to learn module IDs and what exists.\n
    - You need to find which module contains a document type (e.g. "where are Sale Orders?").\n
    - You want to see pending tasks/worklist items that need attention.\n
\n
    DO NOT USE THIS WHEN:\n
    - You already know the module ID — go directly to erp5_search or erp5_inspect.\n
    - You need to read a specific document — use erp5_read with its relative_url.\n
\n
    NEXT STEPS: Use module IDs from the response with erp5_inspect (to learn searchable\n
    fields) or erp5_search (to find documents).\n
    </string> </value>
